---
import Main from '../../layouts/Main.astro';
---

<Main title='Carlos Gamez | About' bodyClass='about'>
  <main class='grid-container grid-container--about flow'>
    <p class='p-1'>I’ve always been drawn to making things.</p>

    <p class='p-2'>
      Sometimes I make music. I’ll spend hours adjusting small details like a
      tone, a rhythm, or a transition, just to get something to feel right. For
      me, it’s more about listening closely than finishing quickly. Other times,
      I focus on more physical projects. I like building wooden furniture and
      return to it whenever I can. The work is slower. You measure, cut, adjust,
      and sometimes start over. It feels good to work with your hands and watch
      something come together piece by piece.
    </p>

    <p class='p-3'>
      I also spend a lot of time outside with my four huskies. Two of them are
      rescues. They’re chaotic in the best way. Being with them helps me get out
      of my head, reminds me to be patient, and not to overthink everything. I
      guess all of that says something about how I see things.
    </p>

    <p class='p-4'>
      I like paying attention to details, but I’m also comfortable with things
      taking time. I enjoy the process as much as the outcome. I often return to
      projects, refining, rebuilding, and rethinking them until they feel right.
    </p>
  </main>
</Main>

<style>
  .grid-container--about {
    --flow-space: 2rem;
    text-align: start;
    grid-template-areas:
      'p1'
      'p2'
      'p3'
      'p4';

    & .p-1 {
      grid-area: p1;
    }

    & .p-2 {
      grid-area: p2;
    }

    & .p-3 {
      grid-area: p3;
    }

    & .p-4 {
      grid-area: p4;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 45em) {
    .grid-container--about {
      justify-items: start;
      align-content: start;
      grid-template-areas:
        '. p1 p1 .'
        '. p2 p2 .'
        '. p3 p3 .'
        '. p4 p4 .';
    }
  }
</style>
